<title>USA: Heinz names Bowen retail group president.</title>
<headline>Heinz names Bowen retail group president.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.J. Heinz Co said on Friday it named Peter Bowen president of Heinz USA Retail Products Group, replacing Brian Ruder, who took a job with Citicorp unit Citibank.</p>
<p>Bowen, 45, currently is president of Heinz's Starkist Seafood Co affiliate.  He takes up his new duties March 17.</p>
<p>Ruder will be executive vice president of global marketing for Citibank in New York.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
